      "content": "I hear what you're saying, and I'm genuinely sorry you're feeling this profound exhaustion and disconnection. It sounds incredibly tough, and it's important to recognize your feelings and the toll your environment and expectations are taking on you. Have you considered seeking support from a mental health professional, who can work with you to address feelings of burnout and help you find a path forward that feels more authentic and fulfilling to you? Giving yourself permission to rest, reset, and pursue activities that bring you joy, regardless of your career or societal pressures, may also be a crucial step in finding balance. You don't have to play on someone else's timeline. Your health and happiness are the top priority.",
      "source": "target",
